PS+=['Zoe: I went to the best wedding ever last weekend. Look at this photo.\nAlan: Hmm. The bride is beautiful, but... how old is she?\nZoe: Well, she’s turning 62 this August. In fact, she’s my mom.\nAlan: What? That’s great! She finally met the right person. Your father left you when you were only 8, right?\nZoe: Right. I was so angry with him then. But everything is different now because he’s back.\nAlan: What does that mean?\nZoe: 【Look at the groom】. He is my father, George.\nAlan: Wow! I can’t believe it! You went to your parents’ wedding.\nZoe: That’s right. I’m so happy for them. They fought a lot in the past, but they don’t do that now.\nAlan: Why didn’t you tell us the good news?\nZoe: I didn’t know about it until last month. My dad called my mom about two years ago. They began going out for dinner and movies then, but they kept it a secret from me. Isn’t it crazy to get married again after more than twenty years?\nAlan: Ha! I’m so happy for your family.\n（wedding 婚禮　bride 新娘　secret 祕密）']
