PS+=['【Angel】\nIn today’s world, people do many things with the Internet. For example, people send e-mails and pay with online banking. Each person has about seven accounts for different things. What’s more, people upload photos or videos to Facebook, Instagram, and so on. As people spend more time on the Internet, a 【question】 becomes more and more important—_____ You may not want people to keep seeing your photos and videos on the Internet. You may want someone to help you take care of your Facebook account. And how do you want people to remember you when you are not in this world?\nIf you care about any of the above, let Angel help you.\n\nAngel’s Services—After you pass away...\n・We help you delete any of your accounts.\n・We help you cancel any of your subscriptions.\n・We help you send e-mails, photos, or videos.\n　For example, some grandparents ask us to send birthday cards to their grandchildren every year after they pass away.\n\nWith $10 a month, Angel will help you a lot in the future.\n（online banking 網路銀行服務　account 帳號　delete 刪除　cancel 取消　subscription 訂閱）']
