PS+=['This month, a strange video showed up on YouTube. In the video, a man went to a small town in Japan. He soon found the town terrible. There were zombies all over the place. He wanted to get away, but he couldn’t because there were too many zombies. He hid in a house and made this video. He explained the ways to stay safe. “When the zombies get close, try not to move. And don’t make any noise because they can hear everything,” he said.\nIn fact, the video is about the zombie camp in Matsuzaki, a small town in Japan. Only about 6,000 people live in Matsuzaki now. People there hold the camp to draw more people to visit their beautiful town. Besides, the visitors can scare away wild animals as well. That way, they don’t eat up their important plants—Sakura Mochi Leaves.\n\n【Zombie Camp】\nMost people in Matsuzaki got infected and turned into zombies!\nWhy did they get infected?\nCan you find out the answer to save everyone in this town?\nPlace: Hennamura Camp, Matsuzaki\nTime: Every weekend in August: 8/6～8/7、8/13～8/14、8/20～8/21、8/27～8/28\nPrice: ¥25,000 / each person\n* Up to 100 people for each camp\n* Only people between the ages of 20 and 40 can join\nGo to Matsuzakizombie.com.jp to sign up now!\n（zombie 殭屍　besides 此外　scare away 把……嚇跑　wild 野生的　infected 受感染的）']
