(37,'What did Dr. Green probably say to Sandra?',['“Thank you for the article. It’s helpful for everyone.”','“Eat more fruit. The sugar inside is good for you.”','“The article is OK, but having your own fruit plan would be better.”','“Have an apple before bed, and you won’t get cramps so often.”'],[],len(PS)-1),
