PS+=['Dear Mom,\nThank you for the Coco recipe. The delicious small cake saved my business. People are crazy about it, and I’m selling a lot now. In fact, I might have too many customers.\nWe open at 9 a.m., but people start to wait in line for Coco at about 8. When the line gets long, some people have to stand in front of Lala. Mr. Hall, the shopkeeper of Lala, is not happy about this. In his eyes, the long line blocks his way and makes him lose customers. Well, I visited his store once. He is losing customers because his store is dark and dirty, not because of me or my customers. “Try to make your store brighter. Then when people are here for Coco, they might want to walk into your store too,” I told him. That made things worse. The next day, he even shouted at my customers and asked them to leave. Because of him, sometimes my customers have to stand in the middle of the road, and that is very dangerous. What’s more, people in line sometimes fight with one another, and the noise makes Mr. Hall even angrier. Are there any ways to bake Coco faster? I really can’t let things go on like this. :(\nLove,\nBecky\n（recipe 食譜　customer 顧客）']
